# README sections that scripts/wiki-sync.sh publishes as wiki pages, in sidebar order.
# One per line: the page name, a space, then the exact text of a level-two heading in README.md.
# A heading named here that is not in the README fails the sync, so renaming a heading means
# renaming it here too. A page name must not be a docs/ file name, since that doc is a page too.

install Install
quick-start Quick start
what-it-renders What it renders
configuring-it Configuring it
caching-design The caching design, which is the whole point
deploying-in-brief Deploying
what-it-reads What it reads
security Security
measured-behaviours Two behaviours that were measured, not assumed
look-check-in-brief The look check
working-on-the-engine Working on the engine
status Status
